      "type": "html",
      "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1>حقيبة واحدة… إطلالتان، وفخامة تناسبك كل يوم ✨</h1><p><strong>حقيبة نسائية فاخرة 2 في 1 بتصميم مجدول أنيق — تُحمل كحقيبة ظهر أو حقيبة كتف حسب إطلالتك.</strong></p><p>السعر:2700<br /></p><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgZFNvOocv4HV1gA-j8lOwpvC6Ka4PfoAwd7N-LrKcvup0ZkeHKd1CCnm_yLAii68kDNsQPqZccR1wiCmHMZs4Il0JV5OBHlKskSpyyuHW_PVSs5vxi6oTKcN9OMj2JpY-BEe8nPWESQLB3bWEwLvFd7E5zXarV0OXewOkimPYoNSRo8V3Q6WsqTgj0HQ/s1000/CrankLeather4.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhM83tRsfnYAjNPqKPDW5mzeDBQzHHMYAihyphenhypheniT6a5kmRY1tYTeigTA5qQ1Etf22ub3Hmca2iAJ6hG-F9y1oBeYZDbdxhs2z7TrLrAnz5OY8ccgZGZlXcBuEXX9nxR8LpabyzXQT5UgII2tSvs4CiKnp4THPSbf0zklviB-fLpd6MXTBB_O0dNII3oceDA/s1000/CrankLeather4.webp\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1000\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhM83tRsfnYAjNPqKPDW5mzeDBQzHHMYAihyphenhypheniT6a5kmRY1tYTeigTA5qQ1Etf22ub3Hmca2iAJ6hG-F9y1oBeYZDbdxhs2z7TrLrAnz5OY8ccgZGZlXcBuEXX9nxR8LpabyzXQT5UgII2tSvs4CiKnp4THPSbf0zklviB-fLpd6MXTBB_O0dNII3oceDA/s320/CrankLeather4.webp\" width=\"320\" /></a><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjfWoBtBeXxa3MEtO8nX-J0Ci-ufiptGG7p2yT_H1OKmL532J2f69obFJK6l6q_Xt00zyeZxoPC19m0PzNO6wP3mvP8CCXbeTOP47nHFjjYmNlK2wBeLTZTnD3Q0TQoVKTCPLr3DHv2yEskPcyPnzWBWlhRwxpdVl_xw89kcIEJkAn-E6dCI0OjXH79mw/s800/H25f9e0fa4dc549099b28bc8c29ae692bi.jpg_960x960q80.webp\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"800\" data-original-width=\